  "dcterms:title": "EPA ChemExpo / CPDat \u2014 RDF integration",
  "dcterms:description": "Streaming RDF (N-Triples) integration of the EPA ChemExpo / CPDat exposure evidence. It is derived entirely from the upstream `epa-chemexpo` BioBricks brick (its sole declared dependency), converting all eight ChemExpo source tables \u2014 product composition, chemicals, PUC hierarchy and attributes, functional-use records and categories, list-presence records and keyword definitions \u2014 into linked-data triples with CompTox DTXSID and CAS IRIs. The underlying data is U.S. EPA public-domain ChemExpo data with row-level third-party provenance retained.",
